FerrionOS change to upstream RedoxFS (MIT license, kept), made against upstream commit 5ba45a6887374ab425326656a276bb3b62eba7dc after the existing recipe patches.

RedoxFS reports a block-driver error or short transfer on DiskRing::disk_op as an error of the request instead of completing it, stops submitting new operations once an error is recorded, and drains all in-flight completions so DMA buffer slices are released.

